</score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>So day by day help me open more,</l><l>Lord, dig away all that blocks You.</l><l>Drop by drop may Your life in me increase;</l><l>Till just You are in view,</l><l>I pursue.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>